1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Predictive Forecasting of Care Load and Placement Demand

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
This project forecasts future care load and discharge demand using historical daily data.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Tools used: Python, pandas, scikit-learn, statsmodels, Plotly, and Streamlit.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The app shows latest care load, future forecast, capacity risk, model comparison, and downloadable results.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:54,000
I learned data cleaning, feature engineering, time-series forecasting, model evaluation, and dashboard deployment.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:06,000
This project shows how predictive analytics can support planning and operational decisions.
